5,1,1,talk,Servas,,I believe we should start by clarifying our internal reporting and verification processes. I'll look into independent checks on holdings' reported figures and appraisal needs at the last audit.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I want to verify the actual drivers of our returns. I will examine account retention through price rises and the profile of the exits and the write-off.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minako,,"I need to understand our long-term financial commitments and liquidity. I'll look into reserve accounts and follow-on calls, as well as the terms of last winter's credit line.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mio,,I'm curious about how we're handling the people side of things! I'll check the retained recruiters' placement times and the adviser bench and partner board seats.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I will focus on the operational delays we've encountered. I'll look into the security review time before first deployment and the delivery records of two holdings.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,It seems we have a comprehensive spread of investigations. Does anyone feel we are overlooking a critical angle before we proceed with these checks?,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"I believe we have covered the essential bases. The combination of financial liquidity, operational timing, and customer retention should give us a clear framework for the final selection.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minako,,I agree. We have a balanced approach that addresses both the fund's health and the operational risks of the candidates. Let's move forward with these selections.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mio,,I'm all set too! I can't wait to see what we find out. Let's get to it!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I concur. The current distribution of research is sufficient to identify the risks associated with our next investment. I have no further additions.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Since we are all in agreement, I believe we have reached a consensus on our research priorities for this round. I am satisfied with the current plan.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,pass,Asuka,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minako,,I am also satisfied. We have a clear division of labor and a broad scope of inquiry. I believe we are ready to receive the findings.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Mio,,Me too! I'm ready to see what the recruiters and advisers are up to. Let's see the results!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,pass,Toshio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Servas,,Then we shall conclude this round. I look forward to seeing how these insights shape our decision for the seed investment.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
